[thin] Specific required legend relief: each reading is the tip of a letter's own outline in the raised disposal warning, 6.5 mm Helvetica Bold caps. Every R's leg ends on the baseline on a vertical terminal 0.16 mm tall, and the K's upper arm meets the cap line in a 45° point, so each tip is under 0.25 mm thick over its last few tenths of a millimetre. Each letter keeps that outline down to its 45° underside.
alternatives: Cutting the tips back to a wider terminal changes Helvetica's outline on every R and on the K; another typeface changes the approved legend.
